async function boot(){const t=epoch;try{await optionsFor(t);if(current(t))await loadList(t);}catch(e){if(current(t))unavailable(e.message||'当前库存原件范围已不可用');}}
async function search(reset=true){if(!localKind.value||localId.value)return;if(reset)catalogPage.value=1;const t=epoch,v=++catalogVersion,requested={item_kind:localKind.value,keyword:keyword.value,page:catalogPage.value,page_size:20};try{const data=(await getInventorySourceOptions(requested)).data;if(!current(t)||v!==catalogVersion)return;if(!inventorySourceOptionsValid(data,requested))throw new Error('真实SKU检索分页无法核对');catalog.value=clone(data.items);catalogTotal.value=data.total;}catch(e){if(current(t)&&v===catalogVersion)unavailable(e.message||'实际SKU检索失效');}}
function changeKind(kind){localId.value=null;selectedName.value='';localKind.value=kind;emit('scope-change',{item_kind:kind,item_id:null});}
function selectItem(id){if(id!==null&&!catalog.value.some(x=>x.item_id===id))return;localId.value=id;selectedName.value=catalog.value.find(x=>x.item_id===id)?.name||'';emit('scope-change',{item_kind:localKind.value,item_id:id});}
async function loadList(t=epoch){if(!current(t))return;if(!props.auditOnly&&(!localId.value||!sourceKind.value)){rows.value=[];total.value=0;return;}const l=++listVersion;loading.value=true;try{const requested={...(localKind.value?{item_kind:localKind.value}:{}),...(localId.value?{item_id:localId.value}:{}),...(sourceKind.value?{source_kind:sourceKind.value}:{}),page:page.value,page_size:20};const data=(await(props.auditOnly?getAdminInventorySources(requested):getInventorySources(sourceKind.value,requested))).data;if(!current(t)||l!==listVersion)return;if(!data||!Array.isArray(data.items)||!Number.isSafeInteger(data.total)||data.total<0||data.page!==page.value||data.page_size!==20||data.items.length>20||data.items.length>data.total||data.detail_required!==true||!data.items.every(v=>inventorySourceMetadataValid(v,{kind:sourceKind.value,itemKind:localKind.value,itemId:localId.value})&&!['payload','parent_binding','review_basis_note','revoke_reason','eligible'].some(k=>Object.hasOwn(v,k))))throw new Error('原件技术目录、范围或完整分页无法核对');rows.value=clone(data.items);total.value=data.total;}catch(e){if(current(t)&&l===listVersion)unavailable(e.message||'原件目录已失效');}finally{if(current(t)&&l===listVersion)loading.value=false;}}
function reload(){clear();page.value=1;if(current(epoch))boot();}
async function inspect(meta){const t=epoch,v=++detailVersion;closeCreate();detail.value=null;showOriginal.value=false;basis.value='';try{const row=(await(props.auditOnly?getAdminInventorySource(meta.source_record_id):getInventorySource(meta.source_kind,meta.source_record_id,{audit_only:false}))).data;if(!current(t)||v!==detailVersion)return;if(!await verifyInventorySourceWrapper(row,{auditOnly:props.auditOnly,itemKind:meta.item_kind,itemId:meta.item_id})||['source_record_id','source_kind','content_hash','governance_hash','status','revision'].some(k=>row[k]!==meta[k]))throw new Error('完整原件与所选技术身份或当前治理已变化，请刷新');if(!current(t)||v!==detailVersion)return;detail.value=clone(row);}catch(e){if(current(t)&&v===detailVersion)unavailable(e.message||'当前完整原件不可读取');}}
function seedPayload(){const schema=inventorySourceSchema('SourceCreate'),resolve=v=>v?.$ref?schema.$defs[v.$ref.split('/').at(-1)]:v,model=schema.properties.payload.oneOf.map(resolve).find(v=>v.properties.kind.const===sourceKind.value);return Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(model.properties).filter(([,v])=>typeof resolve(v)?.const==='string').map(([key,value])=>[key,resolve(value).const]));}
async function openCreate(){if(!localId.value||!sourceKind.value||!options.value?.can_record)return;closeDetail();closeCreate();creating.value=true;form.value={...params(),scope:'hospital_inventory',unit_definition_id:undefined,expected_unit_content_hash:undefined,expected_unit_governance_hash:undefined,expected_legacy_digest:null,payload:seedPayload()};const t=epoch,v=formVersion;unitLoading.value=true;try{const collected=[];let totalUnits=null;for(let p=1;;p++){const requested={...params(),page:p,page_size:100},data=(await getSupplySources('unit',requested)).data;if(!current(t)||v!==formVersion||!creating.value)return;if(!data||!Array.isArray(data.items)||data.page!==p||data.page_size!==100||!Number.isSafeInteger(data.total)||data.total<0||data.total>4096||totalUnits!==null&&data.total!==totalUnits||data.items.length>100||!data.items.every(x=>supplySourceMetadataValid(x,{kind:'unit',itemKind:localKind.value,itemId:localId.value})))throw new Error('原计数单位完整目录无法核对');totalUnits=data.total;collected.push(...data.items);if(collected.length>=data.total)break;if(!data.items.length)throw new Error('单位目录被截断');}if(new Set(collected.map(x=>x.source_record_id)).size!==collected.length||collected.length!==totalUnits)throw new Error('单位目录重复或缺项');const values=[];for(const meta of collected.filter(x=>x.status==='published'&&x.eligible)){const row=(await getSupplySource('unit',meta.source_record_id,{audit_only:false})).data;if(!current(t)||v!==formVersion||!creating.value)return;if(!await verifySupplySourceWrapper(row,{kind:'unit',itemKind:localKind.value,itemId:localId.value})||!row.eligible||row.content_hash!==meta.content_hash||row.governance_hash!==meta.governance_hash)throw new Error('所列单位完整原件已变化');if(!current(t)||v!==formVersion||!creating.value)return;values.push(row);}units.value=clone(values);}catch(e){if(current(t)&&v===formVersion)unavailable(e.message||'原单位读取已不可用');}finally{if(current(t)&&v===formVersion)unitLoading.value=false;}}
function chooseUnit(key){const u=units.value.find(v=>v.source_record_id===key);if(key!=='__none__'&&!u)return;selectedUnit.value=u||null;form.value={...form.value,unit_definition_id:u?.source_record_id??null,expected_unit_content_hash:u?.content_hash??null,expected_unit_governance_hash:u?.governance_hash??null};}
const validForm=computed(()=>creating.value&&form.value&&inventorySourceRequestValid('SourceCreate',form.value));
async function readRaw(){if(!creating.value||sourceKind.value!=='inventory_observation')return;const t=epoch,v=++rawVersion,f=formVersion;rawLoading.value=true;try{const value=(await captureInventoryLegacy({...params(),scope:'hospital_inventory'})).data;if(!current(t)||v!==rawVersion||f!==formVersion||!creating.value)return;if(!await verifyInventoryLegacyCapture(value)||value.item_kind!==localKind.value||value.item_id!==localId.value)throw new Error('原库存完整胶囊无法核对');if(!current(t)||v!==rawVersion||f!==formVersion||!creating.value)return;raw.value=clone(value);rawPage.value=1;showRaw.value=false;}catch(e){if(current(t)&&v===rawVersion&&f===formVersion)unavailable(e.message||'当前原库存读取失效');}finally{if(current(t)&&v===rawVersion&&f===formVersion)rawLoading.value=false;}}
function bindRaw(){if(raw.value&&creating.value)form.value={...form.value,expected_legacy_digest:raw.value.collection_digest};}
async function save(){if(!validForm.value||saving.value)return;const t=epoch,v=formVersion,body=clone(form.value),submitted=supportCanonical(body);saving.value=true;try{const row=(await createInventorySource(sourceKind.value,body)).data;if(!current(t)||v!==formVersion||!creating.value)return;if(!await verifyInventorySourceWrapper(row,{auditOnly:roles.value.includes('super_admin'),itemKind:localKind.value,itemId:localId.value})||row.status!=='draft'||row.source_kind!==body.payload.kind||!same(row.payload,body.payload)||row.unit_definition_id!==body.unit_definition_id||body.expected_legacy_digest!==null&&row.parent_binding.legacy_snapshot?.collection_digest!==body.expected_legacy_digest)throw new Error('保存回执未绑定本次完整原文、实际SKU、单位或已审阅库存摘要');if(!current(t)||v!==formVersion||!creating.value||supportCanonical(form.value)!==submitted)return;closeCreate();detail.value=clone(row);basis.value='';showOriginal.value=false;emit('source-changed',row);await loadList(t);}catch(e){if(current(t)&&v===formVersion)unavailable(e.message||'本次保存未获得可核对回执');}finally{if(current(t)&&v===formVersion)saving.value=false;}}
const same=(a,b)=>supportCanonical(a)===supportCanonical(b);
async function govern(action){const before=detail.value;if(!before||saving.value||!(action==='revoke'?inventoryRevokeBasis(basis.value):inventorySourceBasis(basis.value)))return;const t=epoch,v=detailVersion,body={expected_revision:before.revision,expected_content_hash:before.content_hash,basis_note:basis.value};if(action!=='revoke')body.decision=action;saving.value=true;try{const row=(await(action==='revoke'?revokeInventorySource(before.source_kind,before.source_record_id,body):reviewInventorySource(before.source_kind,before.source_record_id,body))).data;if(!current(t)||v!==detailVersion)return;if(!await verifyInventorySourceTransition(row,before,action,body)||row.audit_only!==roles.value.includes('super_admin'))throw new Error('当前治理回执未绑定原件、CAS或本次明确依据');if(!current(t)||v!==detailVersion)return;detail.value=clone(row);basis.value='';showOriginal.value=false;emit('source-changed',row);await loadList(t);}catch(e){if(current(t)&&v===detailVersion)unavailable(e.message||'当前原件无法治理');}finally{if(current(t)&&v===detailVersion)saving.value=false;}}
function unitChanged(value){clear();emit('source-changed',value);if(current(epoch))boot();}
function unitUnavailable(){if(unitDialog.value)unavailable('当前单位来源或权限已变化，请重新读取');}
watch(()=>[props.itemKind,props.itemId],([kind,id])=>{localKind.value=kind;localId.value=id;},{flush:'sync'});
watch(scope,()=>{clear(initialized);initialized=true;page.value=catalogPage.value=1;if((localKind.value!==null&&!['pharmaceutical','consumable'].includes(localKind.value))||(localId.value!==null&&(!localKind.value||!inventorySourcePositive(localId.value)))){error.value='父级实际SKU边界无效，已清除旧资料';return;}if(current(epoch))boot();},{immediate:true,flush:'sync'});
onDeactivated(()=>{live=false;clear();});onActivated(()=>{if(!live){live=true;clear(false);if(current(epoch))boot();}});onUnmounted(()=>{destroyed=true;live=false;clear(false);});
</script>
